      "date": "2026-05-13T11:52:27.000Z",
      "title": "Dividend increased to ₹4.20",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹4.20 is 5.0% higher than last year. Ex-date: 12th June 2026 Payment date: 23rd July 2026 Dividend yield will be 3.2%, which is higher than the industry average of 1.1%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is well covered by earnings (18% payout ratio) and is expected to be well covered in 3 years' time (20% forecast payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 7.2% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. EPS is expected to grow by 5.3% over the next 3 years, which should provide support to the dividend and adequate earnings cover.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
    },
