      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹23.96 (vs ₹19.34 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹23.96 (up from ₹19.34 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹558.2b (flat on FY 2025). Net income: ₹197.1b (up 12% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 35% (up from 32% in FY 2025). Revenue is forecast to grow 13% p.a. on average during the next 3 years, compared to a 1.9% growth forecast for the Banks industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 18% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 29% per year, which means it is tracking significantly ahead of earnings growth.",
